{"4951190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Konbini Cleanup", "steam_appid": 4951190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Konbini Cleanup</strong> is a cozy organizing simulator about putting a messy Japanese convenience store back in order. Sort 2,928 products across 15+ sections: drinks, noodles, candy, chips, and more. All at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Relaxing Konbini Organizing Simulator</strong><br>The store is a mess and needs to be cleaned up. Return items to their shelves at your own pace, with no timers and no pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/ab1db662022aaec891c77195e6da253f.avif?t=1787737570\" width=1170 height=155 /></span>Pick up each product, find the right section, and place it under the correct price tag. That's all there is to it, just work through the store one shelf at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/63a6e57e528a8048d5338eceeeffa57e.poster.avif?t=1787737570\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/63a6e57e528a8048d5338eceeeffa57e.webm?t=1787737570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/63a6e57e528a8048d5338eceeeffa57e.mp4?t=1787737570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/4044cc60a12f179ae74446b8244d381a.avif?t=1787737570\" width=1170 height=155 /></span>Earn upgrades as you play. Increase your movement speed and reach, and unlock a couple of unique abilities that make clearing the store faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/30d1386eabc6dad5ccc86ad4126dccb5.poster.avif?t=1787737570\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/30d1386eabc6dad5ccc86ad4126dccb5.webm?t=1787737570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/30d1386eabc6dad5ccc86ad4126dccb5.mp4?t=1787737570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/ef5ca3b34a076c8cd30be9d494156830.avif?t=1787737570\" width=1170 height=155 /></span>Empty racks fill with neat rows of onigiri, and the messy magazine stand settles into tidy stacks. Each finished section shows clear progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/8dcbc4c8b658dd505f95b5429cc6ba07.poster.avif?t=1787737570\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/8dcbc4c8b658dd505f95b5429cc6ba07.webm?t=1787737570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/8dcbc4c8b658dd505f95b5429cc6ba07.mp4?t=1787737570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort more than 2,900 products across 15+ konbini sections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple gameplay: pick up items and put them back where they belong</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill upgrades for speed and reach, plus a few unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limits and no game over. A relaxed pace you set yourself</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Konbini Cleanup</strong> is a cozy organizing simulator about putting a messy Japanese convenience store back in order. Sort 2,928 products across 15+ sections: drinks, noodles, candy, chips, and more. All at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Relaxing Konbini Organizing Simulator</strong><br>The store is a mess and needs to be cleaned up. Return items to their shelves at your own pace, with no timers and no pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/ab1db662022aaec891c77195e6da253f.avif?t=1787737570\" width=1170 height=155 /></span>Pick up each product, find the right section, and place it under the correct price tag. That's all there is to it, just work through the store one shelf at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/63a6e57e528a8048d5338eceeeffa57e.poster.avif?t=1787737570\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/63a6e57e528a8048d5338eceeeffa57e.webm?t=1787737570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/63a6e57e528a8048d5338eceeeffa57e.mp4?t=1787737570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/4044cc60a12f179ae74446b8244d381a.avif?t=1787737570\" width=1170 height=155 /></span>Earn upgrades as you play. Increase your movement speed and reach, and unlock a couple of unique abilities that make clearing the store faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/30d1386eabc6dad5ccc86ad4126dccb5.poster.avif?t=1787737570\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/30d1386eabc6dad5ccc86ad4126dccb5.webm?t=1787737570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/30d1386eabc6dad5ccc86ad4126dccb5.mp4?t=1787737570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/ef5ca3b34a076c8cd30be9d494156830.avif?t=1787737570\" width=1170 height=155 /></span>Empty racks fill with neat rows of onigiri, and the messy magazine stand settles into tidy stacks. Each finished section shows clear progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/8dcbc4c8b658dd505f95b5429cc6ba07.poster.avif?t=1787737570\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/8dcbc4c8b658dd505f95b5429cc6ba07.webm?t=1787737570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951190/extras/8dcbc4c8b658dd505f95b5429cc6ba07.mp4?t=1787737570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"